        <mxCell id="note" value="Denials return to the agent too. AuditHooks record every call with &lt;b&gt;decision.result&lt;/b&gt; (allowed / denied) and &lt;b&gt;decision.reason&lt;/b&gt; (for example RATE_LIMITED or P30_forbid_mutations_1)." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6B86;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="500" width="350" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
